    GC_Briefing "{3964B378EA7C1322}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "Rogue Soviet forces have taken control of Everon. NATO is scrambling to respond before the invaders can get fully dug in to the island."\
     ""\
     "US Army Rangers are planning an airfield seizure of St Phillipe airport later in the day, to commence NATO's response. In aid of this, an SAS squadron with an attached US helo element has been tasked with conducting an air raid to sabotage several supporting elements located south of the airport."
    }
    GC_Briefing "{A0F6AF238EE61E56}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "Destroy the following:"\
     ""\
     "- 1x Ural communications truck located at the Soviet Signals marker."\
     "- 3x 2S1 artillery pieces located at the Soviet Artillery marker."\
     "- 2x Ural ammo trucks located at the Soviet supply marker."\
     ""\
     "Each objective can be expected to be defended by roughly a platoon sized element of Soviet regulars. QRFs may be dispatched to the objective from either the north or south if you take too long at each location."
    }
    GC_Briefing "{7369B8848FE9D4A0}" {
